## Article 7. Prohibition of Refusal to Accept and Review Appeal

```catala
declaration scope Article7ProhibitionOfRefusal:
  input meetsRequirements content YesNo
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealForm content AppealForm
  input appealType content AppealType
  input politicalViewsMentioned content YesNo
  input partyMembershipMentioned content YesNo
  input genderMentioned content YesNo
  input ageMentioned content YesNo
  input religionMentioned content YesNo
  input nationalityMentioned content YesNo
  input appealLanguageUnknown content YesNo
  input addresseeHasAuthority content YesNo
  input infoIncomplete content YesNo
  input isComplaintAgainstAddressee content YesNo
  output cannotRefuseAcceptance content YesNo
  output refusalProhibited content YesNo
  output mustTransfer content YesNo
  output transferDeadlineDays content integer
  output mustReturnWithExplanation content YesNo
  output cannotForwardToSubjectOfComplaint content YesNo

scope Article7ProhibitionOfRefusal:
  label acceptance_required exception default_acceptance
  definition cannotRefuseAcceptance under condition
    meetsRequirements = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_acceptance
  definition cannotRefuseAcceptance equals No

  label refusal_prohibited_exception default_refusal
  definition refusalProhibited under condition
    cannotRefuseAcceptance = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_refusal
  definition refusalProhibited equals No

  label must_transfer_exception default_transfer
  definition mustTransfer under condition
    refusalProhibited = Yes and addresseeHasAuthority = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_transfer
  definition mustTransfer equals No

  label transfer_deadline_exception default_transfer_deadline
  definition transferDeadlineDays under condition
    mustTransfer = Yes
    consequence equals 5

  label default_transfer_deadline
  definition transferDeadlineDays equals 0

  label return_for_info_exception default_return
  definition mustReturnWithExplanation under condition
    refusalProhibited = Yes and infoIncomplete = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_return
  definition mustReturnWithExplanation equals No

  label cannot_forward_exception default_can_forward
  definition cannotForwardToSubjectOfComplaint under condition
    isComplaintAgainstAddressee = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_can_forward
  definition cannotForwardToSubjectOfComplaint equals No
```
